---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-[#ead9d2] dark:border-[#2d2521] mt-24 py-12 text-xs font-mono text-[#8C7E74] dark:text-[#a89f91] bg-[#F5F0E4]/40 dark:bg-[#191512]/60 transition-colors">
  <div class="max-w-[1720px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-8">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between gap-6 pb-6 border-b border-[#ead9d2]/60 dark:border-[#2d2521]">
      <div class="space-y-1">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="font-serif text-base font-normal text-[#2d2724] dark:text-[#fef9ed]">Ozan Özdil</span>
        </div>
        <p class="font-sans text-xs text-[#8C7E74] dark:text-[#a89f91] max-w-md">
          Yapay zekâ destekli kodlama, açık kaynak sistem mimarileri ve dijital egemenlik.
        </p>
      </div>

      <nav class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-xs font-mono" aria-label="Footer Nav">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-[#2d2724] dark:hover:text-[#fef9ed] transition-colors">Hakkımda</a>
        <a href="/blog" class="hover:text-[#2d2724] dark:hover:text-[#fef9ed] transition-colors">Yazılar</a>
        <a href="/projeler" class="hover:text-[#2d2724] dark:hover:text-[#fef9ed] transition-colors">Projeler</a>
        <a href="/galeri" class="hover:text-[#2d2724] dark:hover:text-[#fef9ed] transition-colors">Galeri</a>
        <a href="/llms.txt" target="_blank" class="hover:text-[#e1734b] dark:hover:text-[#e59a7a] transition-colors flex items-center gap-0.5">llms.txt ↗</a>
      </nav>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-[11px]">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-[#8C7E74] dark:text-[#a89f91]">
        <span>Kastamonu, TR</span>
        <span>•</span>
        <span>© {currentYear} Ozan Özdil</span>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
        <a href="https://buymeacoffee.com/ozdil" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 bg-amber-500/10 hover:bg-amber-500/20 border border-amber-500/20 transition-colors">
          kahve ısmarla ☕
        </a>
        <a href="https://github.com/ozdil/ozanozdil.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-[#F5F0E4] dark:bg-[#26201c] hover:text-[#2d2724] dark:hover:text-[#fef9ed] border border-[#ead9d2] dark:border-[#2d2521] transition-colors">
          repo ↗
        </a>
        <a href="/rss.xml" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-[#F5F0E4] dark:bg-[#26201c] hover:text-[#2d2724] dark:hover:text-[#fef9ed] border border-[#ead9d2] dark:border-[#2d2521] transition-colors">
          rss ↗
        </a>
        <a href="#top" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-[#F5F0E4] dark:bg-[#26201c] hover:text-[#e1734b] dark:hover:text-[#e59a7a] border border-[#ead9d2] dark:border-[#2d2521] transition-colors">
          başa dön ↑
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
